2026-09-26 | supplier-auth-application | PRESERVE | no structural change | shell and session lifecycle already serve the workflow
2026-09-26 | vip-membership | PRESERVE | no structural change | this is the entitlement security boundary for 6.3-C; do not restructure it while exposing the catalog
